WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.080
Tap More, then Journal, then New Entry.

00:04.520 --> 00:08.080
Pick a mood, and write a few words about
how the day felt.

00:08.740 --> 00:12.680
Save it, and it is there in your list,
ready to look back on.

00:13.340 --> 00:17.020
Your entries stay grouped by month, so you
can look back anytime.

